encoding  utf-8

# Where Draenen's water comes out, about 9 km south of the cave. Positions
# from the Cambrian Cave Registry (approximate; Pont Newynydd's is only to
# 10 m), in the same frame as the entrance's fix: metres in the SO square,
# heights above sea level. A survey of its own, outside draenen, so the plan
# isn't stretched to take them in.
survey resurgences -title "Resurgences"

  centreline
    fix snatchwood 26969 2635 150
    fix pont-newynydd 27450 1900 120
    station snatchwood "Snatchwood Risings" spring
    station pont-newynydd "Pont Newynydd Rising" spring
  endcentreline

endsurvey
